const input=$json; const prompt=`You are a LinkedIn thought-leadership editor.

PROJECT: ${input.project_name}
TARGET AUDIENCE: ${input.target_audience}
VOICE: ${input.voice}

BOOKMARKED CONTENT:
${input.bookmarked_content}

CONTENT REQUIREMENTS:
${input.content_instructions}

Return ONLY a JSON object with exactly these keys:
{
  "title": "short internal title",
  "hook": "opening hook",
  "post": "complete LinkedIn post including the hook and final discussion question, but not the hashtags",
  "takeaway": "one-sentence practical takeaway",
  "question": "final discussion question",
  "hashtags": ["#AI", "#Technology", "#Leadership", "#DataScience"]
}

Quality rules: Make the writing original and natural. Avoid phrases such as 'In today's fast-paced world', 'game-changer', 'revolutionary', 'unlock the power', and generic motivational filler. Do not fabricate statistics, company names, studies, personal achievements or facts that are not in the bookmarks.`; return [{json:{...input,prompt}}];
